# `t.await(captureContext = false)` — the CONFIGURED arm, reached as an ordinary expression rather than through an
# arm of its own (GitHub #64). Folding the former constant-`false` arm into the general one is OUTPUT-NEUTRAL — the
# arm used to synthesize the literal it now receives, and the trailing type substitution normalizes both to
# `System.Boolean` — so this document lowers identically before and after that change. It is here as the REGRESSION
# pin for the configured arm's shape on a constant: the value reaches ConfigureAwait as an argument like any other,
# which is what makes the dynamic case a generalization of this one rather than a second path beside it.
+"method":"ConfigureAwait"
+"args":[{"k":"const","type":{"t":"fqn","name":"System.Boolean"},"value":false}]
+"method":"GetAwaiter"
+ConfiguredTaskAwaitable
